   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "Small wins are not small.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "gains": [
      1.1
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "You make your bed. You finish one task. You send that one email you've been avoiding.",
     "mode": "story",
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "text": "It doesn't look like much.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "text": "But something changes inside your head.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.9
    },
    {
     "text": "Brian Tracy says it in Eat That Frog:",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "text": "once you begin a valuable task, you're naturally motivated to continue.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "text": "Your brain loves the feeling of done.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.7
    },
    {
     "text": "And it wants that feeling again.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b",
   "at": "auto",
   "gap": 0.8,
   "min_at": 25.6,
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "One win gives you energy for the next.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.6
    },
    {
     "text": "Then the next. Then the next.",
     "mode": "story",
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "text": "That's momentum.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "gains": [
      1.1
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "So don't start your day with the hardest mountain.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "text": "Start with one small win, and let it pull you forward.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.9
    },
    {
     "text": "Small wins build big days.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.7
    },
    {
     "text": "And big days build a different life.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0,
     "gains": [
      1.1
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
